"""The admitted per-world source inventory of the runtime-capped cohort.

Generated mechanically from the declared `@attune_worlds` archive trees by
filtering each world's exact pinned source tree to the admitted source
extensions (ts, tsx, js, jsx, mjs, cjs). On every one of the 67 worlds whose
`world_extract` inventory is materialized, this reduction is byte-identical to
that world's own declared `sources.tsv`, so the fixture population cannot drift
from the frozen candidate inventory. The excluded runtime-capped groups
(prettier w38-w41, lighthouse w81-w84) are absent by construction.
"""

